{"availability":"available","full":"Xxavier-ml/broka","name":"broka","description":"Ai powered online market ","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Dart","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-21T19:29:16Z","updated":"2026-10-08T21:57:56Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://backend-kohl-two-70.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://backend-kohl-two-70.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:07.890Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:07.890Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:07.890Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:07.890Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["BROKA is a mobile marketplace where buyers and sellers deal through Zeno, an AI broker that negotiates, translates, privately coaches each side, and mediates disputes.","For launch (2026-10-08) BROKA holds no deal money. Buyers pay sellers through one of Kenya's independent escrow services (E-Confirm, Escrow Kenya, Kenya Escrow, Lipasafe, Shikilia), listed in the app and on the web store, and Zeno walks them through it one step at a time. No commission is charged. BROKA's own escrow is built and switched off (INAPPPAYMENTSENABLED), and so are auctions (AUCTIONSENABLED), whose winning bids need it. See CHANGES.md, \"Paying with escrow services, and no auctions for launch\".","Design notes live next to this file: ARCHITECTURE.md, AUCTIONS.md, CALLING.md, EVENTARCHITECTURE.md, PRIVACY.md, ZENOACTIONS.md and SELLERMETRICS.md, plus the audit write-ups (ESCROWAUDIT.md, DISPUTEAUDIT.md, AIAUDIT.md, COMMUNICATIONSAUDIT.md, REPOREVIEW.md)."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Xxavier-ml/broka/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"639e930557e2f75cc40c2da7e35ebaf92f39fb9550ea816498221d1d1e00e86b","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:08.080Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:08.080Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"BROKA is a mobile marketplace where buyers and sellers deal thr